{"id":"fd12fwqeveiia856c4kqnkrhd","title":"东京大学与加州大学伯克利分校合作开发亚5纳米Au/Pt纳米间隙量子光源芯片集成新架构","originalTitle":"Nanogap architecture could help integrate quantum light sources onto chips","summary":"东京大学材料与结构实验室与加州大学伯克利分校教授团队合作，开发出基于亚5纳米Au/Pt纳米间隙的量子光源芯片集成方案。该架构通过电驱动方式实现1.83 meV线宽的窄发射谱（在3.5 K下），相较传统光学激发方式减少多峰谱线问题。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-nanogap-architecture-quantum-sources-chips.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T15:20:10.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T16:13:28.441Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T16:13:28.441Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":56,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"a800bce6-04e9-4e23-8dd1-51d53ed036a1","title":"东京大学与伯克利合作开发亚5纳米量子光源芯片"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"a800bce6-04e9-4e23-8dd1-51d53ed036a1","title":"东京大学与伯克利合作开发亚5纳米量子光源芯片"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fJo8PtOhL4HI","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}